@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 17
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 17
skinparam ParticipantPadding 28
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam ArrowColor #31546F
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A91A5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1F4E78
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1F4E78
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
autonumber

actor 用户 as User
boundary "导入界面" as UI
control "导入协调器" as Coordinator
control "权限校验" as Gate
control "解析服务" as Parser
control "索引服务" as Indexer
database "文档仓库" as Repo

User -> UI : 选择文件并确认导入
UI -> Coordinator : 提交文件、目标空间与授权选择
Coordinator -> Gate : 校验文件类型、空间权限与外发授权

alt 校验失败
  Gate --> UI : 返回原因，不创建文档版本
  UI --> User : 显示可操作的错误提示
else 校验通过
  Gate --> Coordinator : 返回允许的处理路径
  Coordinator -> Repo : 登记Document与DocumentVersion
  Coordinator -> Parser : 异步解析指定版本
  Parser -> Repo : 保存Page、ContentBlock与低置信警告
  Parser -> Indexer : 请求为同一版本建立索引
  Indexer -> Repo : 保存Index与构建状态
  Repo --> UI : 返回解析、索引和警告状态
  UI --> User : 显示就绪或需复核
end
@enduml
